  "numbers+changes": "Limits, defaults, sizes, times and pricing dimensions, then change items. Use 'tables' on docs/vpn/latest/s2svpn/vpn-limits (resources, routes, bandwidth and throughput), docs/directconnect/latest/UserGuide/limits (one table: Component | Quota | Comments) and docs/vpn/latest/clientvpn-admin/limits, and adopt rows with their header. Each value is its own fact (one fact per quota row; one fact per tunnel type for bandwidth and for PPS; dedicated speeds and hosted speeds as two facts; MTU per virtual interface type as separate facts; Client VPN concurrent connections per number of subnets as one fact quoting the whole cell). Change items: date, old value where a page states it, new value, pointer to the current-truth fact; mark items GA after 2026-07-15 as not examinable yet. Two files minimum: facts-numbers-NN.json and facts-changes-NN.json.",
